==Battleground==
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge Back]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Emperor Santa]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Pigge Back]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Lord Enma]] spawns.
**3 [[Christmas D.|Christmas Ds]] spawn, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.

